WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I told you no one is allowed here

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,600
If you don't listen, you're just wasting my net.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,240
This battle doesn’t count your head, but whose head counts?

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:14,800
Just follow me and walk back by yourself

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,080
If you can't keep up, I won't stop and wait for you.

6
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,320
You want to give me this machine

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,380
I won't take advantage of others' danger to make my feet easier to walk.

8
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:25,770
Owe another sum

9
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:36,060
Never mind how you got it

10
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,840
Let’s eat when we get back

11
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:51,260
I still owe you a favor, sister, he's looking at you.
